{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5614e963-f1de-8830-9cde-fbc9d2bc3d76",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T15:56:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:44:45-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Sorry, hang on, I've got a bag in my hands. Okay. I'm calling about water, a storm drain, on my street. Water keeps pooling up in front and it runs into my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What's the address where it's happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:45:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "177 Bellevue Avenue. Up in the Bellevue section."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "177 Bellevue Avenue, got it. Tell me what you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, the water comes down the hill from the next street over. It just comes straight down and goes right into the yard. There's a grate at the curb out front and it's, um, it was mostly covered in leaves and sticks and junk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:46:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is this from the storm earlier in the week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:46:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the snow-to-rain one, Sunday into Monday. That was three days ago now. It's still wet out there. Sorry, let me put this down. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Is the water there right now, or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:46:34-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's down some today. But during the rain it was coming over the curb. I went out and pulled the leaves off the grate by hand. It helped, but only for about ten minutes, and then it started backing up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the grate wasn't totally blocked, it's more that it can't keep up when the water comes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think so, yeah. I mean, I cleared it and it went down for a bit, and then all the runoff from up the hill just overwhelmed it. I don't know what's under there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Any water getting into the house, or is it staying in the yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the yard. Just the yard and the sidewalk. Nothing inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Is it in the street too, or mostly your side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street gets some, but it's mainly along my side by the curb and then across the lawn. Hold on, the door. [pause] Sorry, that's a delivery guy, not mine, wrong house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:48:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happens. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:48:30-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Okay, so what I want to know is when they last came by. Like, when did somebody from the city last clean that drain or check it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at what we have on that location. Give me a moment, I'm pulling up the map."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:49:05-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. I'm seeing the catch basin on that stretch of Bellevue. I don't have a cleaning date showing in the notes I can see from here. That doesn't mean it wasn't done, it just may not be logged where I'm looking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you can't tell me when."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not from this screen. What I can do is put in a service request for a crew to inspect and clean it, and ask the drain crew supervisor to note the last service date and call you back with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that works. I'd like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I have your address. Is the best number the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's a cell. 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170. And I'm sorry, your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yesenia Valdez. V-A-L-D-E-Z."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Valdez. And just to make sure the crew looks in the right place, the water comes from the next street up the hill. Do you know which street that is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one behind us, running along the top. Honestly I'm not sure of the name, I always just call it the upper road. I can say the drain is directly in front of my house, at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:51:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. In front of 177, at the curb. I'll note that the runoff is coming downhill from the street above."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:51:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else in the area, like other drains that look blocked, or is it just the one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that one that I've noticed. There might be another down the block but I haven't looked. Sorry, I'm trying to find my, uh, hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:52:11-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. I'm digging through a pile of mail. I ordered a little space heater, a cheap one, online, and it still hasn't shown up. I keep thinking this is it every time the truck comes by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that's annoying. Is it a cold house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:52:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the back room. It's fine. It's just late. Anyway, not your department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:52:50-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not mine, no, but I hope it turns up. Okay, so I've got the request in for 177 Bellevue Avenue, storm drain at the curb, runoff from the street above, cleared by hand once and backed up again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:53:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's all correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:53:20-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm noting that you'd like the last service date. When the crew gets there, they'll look at the drain and the pipe, and see whether it needs more than a cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:53:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know roughly when someone might come? Just so I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:53:50-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually it's within a week or so for an inspection, though after a storm like this one it can stretch a little, since everybody's calling about drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So next week, probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the likely window, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if it rains again before then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:22-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If the water's coming into the house or the road is flooded enough to be unsafe, call back right away and say so, and it gets bumped up. For just the yard, it stays in the regular line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I can keep clearing the leaves in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:54:56-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, just be careful near the street when it's running heavy, and keep your hands out of the grate itself if you can. A rake works better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll use a rake. Sorry, my cell's cutting a little, can you hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. So the callback, who would call me, the supervisor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either the supervisor or someone from the office here. It'll come from a city number, probably in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll watch for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:55:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a reference number for the request?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Hold on, let me find a pen. [pause] Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's request number 4471."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "4471. Got it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take care, Ms. Valdez. Hope the heater shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T15:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me too. Bye."
    }
  ],
  "attachments": [
